[[Inquisitor Bauer]] is a notorious [[White Mantle inquisition|inquisitor]] of the [[White Mantle]] that appears just outside the [[Gates of Kryta (outpost)|Gates of Kryta]] during [[Wanted: Inquisitor Bauer]] and in a random encounter near [[Ascalon Settlement]]. He is seen interrogating [[Farmer Dirk]], [[Camryn Jamison]] and [[mergoyle]]s. He is [[War Chronicles#April 21st - Inquisitor Bauer at work|said]] to have a demonic urgency and an unnerving stare.

